## Remove Registry → My Tasks (duplicate of Home)

Context: My Tasks already lives on the Home page. The Registry sidebar
"Review → My Tasks" entry (and its dedicated section) was redundant and
added navigational noise without unique behaviour.

Changes:

1. `src/front/config/menu_config.json`
   Dropped the Registry `registry-review` group and its `my-tasks` item.
2. `src/front/templates/registry.html`
   Removed the my-tasks section include plus its CSS/JS assets.
3. `src/front/static/registry/js/registry-my-tasks.js`
   Deleted — unused after the Registry section removal (Home uses
   `home-tasks.js`).
4. `src/front/templates/partials/registry/_registry_my_tasks.html`
   Deleted — Registry-only partial no longer referenced.
5. `src/front/static/registry/css/registry-my-tasks.css`
   Kept (still shared by Home); comment updated to reflect Home usage.
6. `src/front/static/home/js/home-tasks.js`
   Dropped the "mirrors Registry → My Tasks" comment.
7. `src/api/routers/internal/review.py`
   Docstring now points at Home My Tasks instead of Registry.
8. `docs/user-guide.md` + `README.md` + `src/back/objects/registry/store/lakebase/schema.sql`
   User-facing / comment references updated to Home → My Tasks.

Modified files:
- src/front/config/menu_config.json
- src/front/templates/registry.html
- src/front/static/registry/js/registry-my-tasks.js (deleted)
- src/front/templates/partials/registry/_registry_my_tasks.html (deleted)
- src/front/static/registry/css/registry-my-tasks.css
- src/front/static/home/js/home-tasks.js
- src/api/routers/internal/review.py
- docs/user-guide.md
- README.md
- src/back/objects/registry/store/lakebase/schema.sql

